resources.string:
AIDE's built-in implementation reads the module configuration directly. For Android Studio / Gradle builds, also add the following to buildscript in the root build.gradle:

repositories { maven { url 'https://jitpack.io' } }
dependencies { classpath 'com.github.CodingGay:BlackObfuscator-ASPlugin:3.9' }

Module plugin: top.niunaijun.blackobfuscator
Upstream: https://github.com/CodingGay/BlackObfuscator-ASPlugin
